@startuml RecommendationsAPI
title Recomendaciones - entradas y salidas
rectangle "GET detalles existentes" as Detail
note right of Detail
  X-Navigation-Intent: detail-view
  X-Navigation-Id: UUID de visita
  Cookie firmada anonima al responder
  GET 200 y contenido elegible
end note
rectangle "POST /api/recommendations/activity/heartbeat/" as Ping
note right of Ping
  Cookie firmada + CSRF
  navigation_id, content_kind, content_id
  active_seconds acumulado (0..120)
  JSON o multipart para sendBeacon
  204 / 400 / 403 / 404
end note
rectangle "GET /api/recommendations/" as Read
note right of Read
  personalized, generated_at, expires_at
  news, matches, tournaments, discovery
  Elemento: kind, id, title, endpoint, preview, score, reason
  reason incluye similar_visitors
  Sin identidades ni historiales de vecinos
  private, no-store
end note
rectangle "DELETE /api/recommendations/history/" as Clear
note right of Clear
  Cookie firmada + CSRF
  204; elimina cookie, actividad, perfil y snapshot
end note
@enduml
